# Supabase Configuration

This project uses compile-time environment variables to configure Supabase securely.
Never hardcode keys into the application source code.

Exercise creation and editing use the dashboard's authenticated API. The default
is `https://alfdashboard.dellodigital.com`. Override it for another environment
with `--dart-define=DASHBOARD_URL=https://your-dashboard.example`.

## Development Setup

To run the application locally, pass the values via `--dart-define`:

```bash
flutter run \
  --dart-define=SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_ID.supabase.co \
  --dart-define=SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR_PUBLIC_ANON_KEY
```

## Production Setup

For release builds:

```bash
flutter build apk \
  --dart-define=SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_ID.supabase.co \
  --dart-define=SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR_PUBLIC_ANON_KEY
```

> **Note:** Do NOT include `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` in the Flutter application. Any elevated privileges must be handled by secure server functions or Edge Functions.
